&lt;li&gt;Experience with microservices based architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with databases and message queue technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with continuous integration and deployment (CI/CD).&lt;/li&gt;
